{"id":"reference/Hello-World","kind":"langref","title":"你好，世界","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Hello-World","file":"reference/Hello-World.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Hello-World","text":"你好，世界"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Hello-World\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Hello-World/#Hello-World\">你好，世界</a></h2>\n\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">hello.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>(init: std.process.Init) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> std.Io.File.stdout().writeStreamingAll(init.io, <span class=\"tok-str\">\"Hello, World!\\n\"</span>);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe hello.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./hello</kbd>\nHello, World!\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>多数情况下，将消息写入标准错误流比写入标准输出流更合适，并且无须关心消息是否成功写入流。格式化输出也经常有用。针对这种常见情况，可以使用一个更简单的接口：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">hello_again.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    std.debug.print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"Hello, {s}!\\n\"</span>, .{<span class=\"tok-str\">\"World\"</span>});\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe hello_again.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./hello_again</kbd>\nHello, World!\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>此时可以从 <code>main</code> 的返回类型中省略 <code>!</code>，因为该函数不会返回错误。</p>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Values/#Values\">值</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/struct/#Tuples\">元组</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#import\">@import</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Errors\">错误</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Compilation-Model/#Entry-Point\">入口点</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Source-Encoding/#Source-Encoding\">源码编码</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#try\">try</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":13,"translated":13}}
